  <jpcrp030000-asr_E05487-000:NotesRegardingLossOnAbolishmentOfRetirementBenefitPlanTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※４　退職給付制度終了損&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;連結財務諸表「注記事項（連結損益計算書関係）」に同一の内容を記載しているため、注記を省略しております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E05487-000:NotesRegardingLossOnAbolishmentOfRetirementBenefitPlanTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingImpairmentLossTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※５　減損損失&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;連結財務諸表「注記事項（連結損益計算書関係）」に同一の内容を記載しているため、注記を省略しております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingImpairmentLossTextBlock>
